// Owlys, the City under the Abyss (Ch5, MAP_OWLYS): contenu-jeu/chapitres/05-owlys.md §2.
// A monumental neo-gothic city dug into a huge cavern: Hoothoot gargoyles, dark stained glass,
// cathedral spires rising toward an unseen vault, hanging metal walkways over the void, permanent
// darkness pierced only by yellow steam projectors and the red neons of the Cocket warehouses.
// Footprints keep the first build's collision cell for cell (the e2e path and its encounters do
// not move): the Sanctuaire 7x6 (door (30, 12), a non-animated door the feather lock keeps solid,
// METATILE_PORTE_GYM in ch05_owlys.rs), the Pilgrims' Elevator 3x4 (door (30, 3)), the orphanage
// and the warehouse 5x4 (doors (12, 8) and (47, 8)), the Centre 4x4 (animated door (15, 29)), the
// Gray Market 3x2 (door (14, 39)), the East Cave tunnel 3x2 (door (54, 28)), the iron gate 4x1 under its two arrows (`seuil`)
// (arrows (29, 45) and (30, 45)). Floors and walkways are MB_CAVE (the cavern's encounters).
// No connections (warps only): no seams.
(
    name: "SilOwlys",
